    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Holy &amp; Virtuous Heretic is an in-development occult-themed RPG set in the 19th century. When ritualist Aleister becomes embroiled in a quest to summon the daemon Ashmodai, who will stand by his side? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/7a862400892aeef9776166880f62bb39.avif?t=1749345715\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/ab00e3abd472d9495177c4898a90b647.webp?t=1749345715\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Journey with Aleister into a strange world of daemons. Surviving it will require cunning use of both Aleister's skills, and skills of his daemons. Spells and alchemy can be used to apply devastating status effects which could spell victory and downfall in equal parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/739e7ad27d42dc38144b8ac5e04cdc1b.poster.avif?t=1749345715\" width=616 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/739e7ad27d42dc38144b8ac5e04cdc1b.webm?t=1749345715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/5f10a244e6e6d80c9ca948807bae2e93.avif?t=1749345715\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RECRUIT creatures of grimoires shaped by days long past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENGAGE in tense and deliberate battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBSERVE the strange denizens and architecture of a world where nothing is as it seems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SINK deep into strange places with first-person free exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/0b4385935dd59761fca8fdd9a6ad9f4a.poster.avif?t=1749345715\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/0b4385935dd59761fca8fdd9a6ad9f4a.gif?t=1749345715\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
