te battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBSERVE the strange denizens and architecture of a world where nothing is as it seems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SINK deep into strange places with first-person free exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/0b4385935dd59761fca8fdd9a6ad9f4a.poster.avif?t=1749345715\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621030/extras/0b4385935dd59761fca8fdd9a6ad9f4a.gif?t=1749345715\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
